  "goodToKnow": "Der Mediziner (die Medizinerin) is a doctor or medical expert. It's more formal or scientific than der Arzt and is common in news: Mediziner warnen vor... Medical students are also called Mediziner. Die Medizin is medicine as a field, and also a drug: Nimm deine Medizin! In everyday speech, though, a pill is das Medikament. Medizinisch means medical."
